WEBVTT

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.140
I'm done cleaning!

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.810
Next...

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.660
I'm done preparing breakfast,
Master Danblf.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.870
It's going to get cold, Master Danblf.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:21.010
"Episode 2
'I Lied...'"

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:23.850
You're Danblf, right?

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.890
Yes.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.440
You are laughing too much!

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:32.650
Of course I am!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.270
"That Danblf"

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:33.270
Of course I am!

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.860
"That Danblf"

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.860
That Danblf got turned into this thing!

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.650
"This Thing"

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.650
That Danblf got turned into this thing!

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.990
I can't help but laugh about that!

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.080
Man! When I found your name
on the Friends List,

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.330
I practically jumped for joy,

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:52.960
but later, when the person who appeared
with Danblf's Master Key...

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:56.380
...turned out to be this cutesy girl,
a blatant reflection of your tastes...

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.510
How could I have let this happen?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.430
I only did it on a whim.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:10.020
"Done"

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:10.020
I was playing with a Vanity Case I bought
with e-credits that was about to expire,

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.360
"Done"

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:13.360
but... I fell asleep in
the middle of it and...

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:16.070
When I woke up,
I looked like this travesty!

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.820
Even worse, I can't go back
because I don't have the Vanity Case!

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.650
Then, there's no way. You're stuck!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.620
Darn it, you are laughing too much!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.120
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.540
But I haven't laughed
like this in a long time.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.790
Yes, in about 30 years.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:37.800
I had expected something of the sort.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:42.180
The townscape has changed quite a lot.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.720
What's happened besides me?

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.140
I see...

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:52.520
So, you have been protecting
this kingdom all by yourself.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.060
Hey!

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.520
Danblf's come back?

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.980
Luminaria?!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.530
Hey, Solomon!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:05.070
I didn't say she wasn't here.
Only Luminaria came back earlier.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.660
Who is this beautiful girl?

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.870
Danblf.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.750
Huh?

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.920
What the heck? You're crazy cute!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.380
Stop that!

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.800
Oh, when I say "crazy cute,"

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:24.050
I mean that you're so cute,
I want to do crazy things to you!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.890
Stop that, Loony-naria!

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:31.140
Hey, why don't we eat soon?

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.770
There's a lot I want to talk about.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.440
Y-Yes.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.110
Isn't that delicious?

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.400
Mm-hm!

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.490
It's Solomon's favorite.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:48.700
Yeah. I suppose it's one of my pleasures
since things became this way.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.200
Since things became this way...

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.660
So, it's as I suspected.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:57.380
Yes, since that day 30 years ago,
the world has been very different.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.670
Our senses of taste and smell both work.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:04.510
Even though it's supposed
to be just a VRMMO.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:07.930
What exactly is this world?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.430
I don't know.

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.140
After 30 years here?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:16.230
I could make a hypothesis,
but I don't have time to prove it.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:21.070
After all, I didn't have you guys,
the key to our kingdom's defense.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.650
These 30 years, it's all I could do
just to keep this kingdom going.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.570
I feel rather bad about that.

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:28.410
I've worked hard for 20 years, too.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.410
My most profound apologies.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.950
Let's talk about the future instead.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.080
I have a request for you, in particular.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.330
A request for me?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.540
Yes.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:42.250
For that reason, you have
to get used to this world.

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.920
Get used to...?

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:55.680
First, this will come
as unwelcome news to you,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.640
but "Floating Islands" aren't
available to us anymore.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.060
What?!

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.520
That was rough.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.480
M-My collection...

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.450
Fortunately, the storeroom in the
Tower of the Wise Man seems safe,

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.950
so go check it later.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.410
Also, one more thing.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.960
In a sense, you could say
this is the biggest change.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.370
There's even more?

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.720
Master Danblf!

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:36.890
Welcome back, Master Danblf!

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:41.100
What? You're not Master Danblf?

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:45.980
But only Master Danblf
can open the lock here.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:50.740
That was a good one. However...

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.990
This is the Mariana I knew from before?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.960
I'll come straight to the point.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.080
The NPCs are alive.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.170
What do you mean?

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.000
He means just that.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.420
They can be happy. They can be sad.
They're no different from us.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.590
Well, you'll see when
you actually meet one.

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:16.010
It's true. She did not react
in this way before.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:19.430
Perhaps you stole the key
from Master Danblf?!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:21.100
I did not!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.980
Then, you are...?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:29.070
Me? I am...

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:34.160
Oh, yes, yes. For now,
let's keep you being Danblf a secret.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.280
Why?

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:39.910
With such a cutesy Danblf, the other
kingdoms won't take us seriously.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.210
It'll also be confusing for our citizens.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:47.630
It certainly wouldn't be good
to undermine Danblf's dignity.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:48.960
So, what should I do?

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:52.010
Right. For the time being...

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:58.010
I am Danblf's pupil...

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.520
...Mira!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:07.270
Master Danblf's pupil?

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.650
Yes!

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.160
So, where is Master Danblf?

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.620
That's... Oh, that's right!

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:23.330
He's withdrawn to
the Mystic City of Beasts

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.460
to raise a new summoning spirit!

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.750
A new summoning spirit...

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.380
Danblf cannot return for some time.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:34.680
But not to worry.
He has told me about you.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.680
What?

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:42.100
You looked after the Master's estate,
so it did not go to ruin.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.270
For all these 30 long years.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:50.730
On behalf of my master, Danblf,

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.530
let me thank you.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:56.200
I am grateful for the care
you have shown, Mariana.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:02.790
Master Danblf... Miss Mira...

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.790
Your words are more than I deserve.

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:08.630
I've... waited for so long.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.340
It has all been worth it.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:13.800
Yes.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:26.190
This is a bit different from when I was
role-playing with Solomon and the others.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:30.150
It doesn't just thrill. It hurts.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.780
I am sorry, Mariana.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:39.030
I lied.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:47.750
No matter how hard I try,
I cannot avoid it. I know...

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:54.130
I know this, but still, I...

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:11.560
And I used to be so full of dignity...

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:17.900
To succumb to the urge
to pee is mortifying.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.620
But I cannot fight it.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:24.200
Miss Mira, is something the matter?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.500
I heard you saying something!
Are you all right?

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:30.750
It's nothing. I just spoke
a bit without meaning to.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.630
Oh, really?

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.590
Then, please excuse me.

00:10:34.590 --> 00:10:36.010
Right.

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:42.390
I had no idea she was such a worrywart.
I suppose one can never tell.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:43.760
Miss Mira!

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.810
As I said, I just spoke
a bit without meaning to

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.440
and it's nothing to worry about...

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:52.270
Oh, no. There is a messenger on
horseback from the royal capital.

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:55.230
It seems King Solomon wishes to see you.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.780
What's this?

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:01.320
I believe you have all heard,

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.490
but she is the pupil of Danblf.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:08.000
I am Mira. It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:15.630
Now, I have summoned her here
for one reason and one reason alone.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:16.630
Suleiman.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:17.800
Yes.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.130
Several days ago,

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:23.050
we observed the appearance of
packs of monsters in our kingdom.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.850
Packs of monsters?

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.430
Yes, packs in two places.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:30.890
Of which, one is a pack of about
800 monsters in the northwest.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.270
Mistress Luminaria is headed there.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:36.270
I hope the map doesn't change again.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:40.650
And in the region with the flower fields
to the north, a pack of 200.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:44.240
A Lesser Demon has been confirmed there.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.740
A Lesser Demon?

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:50.000
I want to leave vanquishing
them to you, Mira.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.080
Mm-hm.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:53.420
Please wait, Your Majesty!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:58.630
This suspicious nobody of a young girl
cannot be entrusted with this.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.260
That is true.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:06.260
Mira, if you profess
to be Danblf's pupil,

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:10.390
show us your power. Understood?

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.520
As you wish,

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.360
King Solomon.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:29.490
What is this?

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:32.870
This is none other than the secret
weapon of our Kingdom of Alcait,

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.710
the armored jeep.

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.420
It will transport everyone
to the battlefield

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.500
via the shortest, fastest path.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:43.090
Solomon, that crafty bastard.
I had no idea he'd built such a thing.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:45.010
It was supposedly thanks
to your Magic Stones

00:12:45.010 --> 00:12:47.510
that we can now fully utilize it.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:51.640
I, Garrett, thank you on behalf
of the Mobile Armored Division.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.480
Magic Stones?

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:58.270
Oh, that's right. If you have
Magic Stones, could I have them?

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:01.070
Oh, I'll make as many as you want.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.110
Ah, those...

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:08.410
There have been some interesting
developments these last 30 years.

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:10.080
But!

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:13.500
This thing is beyond unkind
to its passengers!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:17.750
We'll continue to improve it,
so please keep the feedback coming!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.300
For starters, it's bad
for my hips and butt!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.510
You cannot take this amount of jostling

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:25.880
and you call yourself a pupil
of the Nine Wise Men?

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.640
Reynard!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.560
I apologize, Miss Mira.

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:37.150
It is fine. Every group experiences
its share of trash talking.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.230
As expected,

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:42.230
the monster pack is heading to
the same point as the other day.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.320
Ah. We can communicate as well?

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.950
But what is this about the same point?

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:52.700
Just the other day, a pack of monsters
appeared in the same way.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.830
Then...

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.330
...the monsters started to
fight each other on the spot.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:02.210
It was like their purpose
was to die there...

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.630
Purpose?

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:09.220
Lesser Demon quests tended to
leave a bad taste in your mouth.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:12.350
There may be more to this
than meets the eye.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.230
We've arrived.

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:21.310
Garrett!

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.230
Well, I wish you luck in battle.

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.030
Miss Mira.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.320
What is it?

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:36.160
King Solomon commanded us to leave it
to you to handle the Lesser Demon.

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.710
But can you really do it?

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.880
You doubt my power?

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.380
I have no reason to believe it.

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:46.090
I suppose that's true.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.890
They're pretty.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.810
And they also smell good.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:58.310
This is what Solomon
is trying to protect.

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.190
And you folk as well.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.150
Of course.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.360
Yes.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:08.240
Then it will be okay.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:10.990
I am the same...

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.450
I won't let you do what you want!

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:20.870
I, Reynard, Commander of the King's Guard
of the Kingdom of Alcait,

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.920
am coming for you!

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.420
O Wind, become a blade!

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:36.930
Oh-ho.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.390
They use a spell to make
the enemy drop their weapons

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:42.690
and then, defeat the incapacitated
enemy with a sword.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:47.690
I see. Solomon has good reason to keep
them by his side. They're interesting!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.780
I know.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.200
It's my turn!

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.000
So, it does have one.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:03.170
A Demon Crystal that summons
a random legendary beast!

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:16.390
Now, what in the world
will we be up against?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.140
A cockatrice?

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:27.860
Oh, no! Its eyes can turn us to stone.

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.200
A Dark Knight?!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.330
When did she summon it?!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.160
It's over.

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:55.550
S-So strong!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:01.350
She is certainly proving worthy
of King Solomon's faith in her.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:11.400
It's emerged.
The Lesser Demon's Grudge Mist...

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:24.500
The Lesser Demon's Grudge Mist has
become one with the legendary beast.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:28.290
Not something that happened
back when this was a game.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:45.270
It seems to have grown
a good deal stronger.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:47.020
Now, then...

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:55.780
Well, well, well...

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:56.950
In the game,

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:00.530
this was an item for show that
we couldn't even touch, but...

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:05.500
To think these things have changed
as well... This could be fun, too.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.750
What say we test it and see
what kind of power it holds?

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.960
Elemental Shift, Dark Knight!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:30.730
Quite the grotesque look.
Shall I call it a Dark Beast, perhaps?

00:18:42.530 --> 00:18:45.500
Oh, I see you wrapped
things up on your end.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.540
Yes.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:49.330
However, this is...

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:54.050
...an epic battle.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.990
I had intended it as an experiment,
but it's quite impressive.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.110
Experiment?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:21.910
But considering how it does
not take detailed commands,

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.740
I must think about when to best use it.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.620
What are you saying?

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:29.710
This thing only takes two commands:
"Go" and "Stop."

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:34.590
What? Whaaaatttt?!

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.500
Time to put a stop to this.

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.470
Send it back.

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.440
Thank goodness...

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.810
Hey!

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:00.610
Now, for the finish.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:13.460
Mm. It's certainly nice
when they really listen to you.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:18.090
Being able to handle that many
summons simultaneously...

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:21.550
The only one who can do that is...

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:24.180
Danblf, the One-Man Army.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:31.850
How was Mira?

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.190
I cannot muster
a single word of criticism.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:36.400
I can only say that she was magnificent.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:40.530
I have no doubt now that
she is Master Danblf's pupil.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:43.820
I see, I'm glad you understand.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:46.660
So, what is the monsters' objective?

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:49.870
We have no proof...

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:53.420
...but they may be trying to
make the "Undead Swamp."

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:57.460
The thing that's supposed
to spawn undead?

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:03.170
A massive quantity of corpses,
many lives being obliterated,

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:06.800
and a place that holds
some kind of power.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.890
All the requirements are met.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:12.230
A Lesser Demon that controls monsters?

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.600
There certainly seems
to be something to this.

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.110
Thanks for your hard work.
You are dismissed.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:18.690
Yes, sire.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:25.030
Demons maneuvering behind the scenes,
the absence of the Nine Wise Men,

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:27.910
and one year left until
the agreement expires...

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.240
We've got a heap of problems.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.370
However, Your Majesty
seems to be having fun.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:34.790
Does it look that way?

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.250
Yes.

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:42.920
It's in this moment
that you came back to us.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:47.300
What an exciting moment
for you to come back,

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.140
Danblf!

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:56.850
I'm done cleaning!

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:58.560
Next...

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:06.450
I'm done preparing breakfast, Miss Mira.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:09.200
Ah! It looks really good!

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.240
Please have your fill!

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:14.250
Yes, I will enjoy this meal!

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:19.920
This is great, Mariana!
